    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d333">

                <pb facs="0499" n="241" xml:id="pg241"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 300.115/28386</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Commercial Adviser of the British Embassy</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Crawford</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Foreign Trade
                        Adviser of the Department of State</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Fleming</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-10-29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 29, 1915</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Mr.</hi>
                    
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Fleming</hi>: In reply to your letter
                    of the 23d instant, I am to acquaint you that it would be impracticable to
                    extend the date for the submission of cases beyond November 1.</p>
                <p>I understand, however, that you may not be able to present complete by that date
                    the cases filed in your office and I am authorized to say that in the
                    circumstances preliminary applications for all these cases should be made by
                    November 1, and where required the additional details may be furnished
                    later.</p>
                <p>Yours very truly,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">R. F. Crawford</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
